EMOTE: Perform a social action

Syntax: emote <action>
        :<action>

DESCRIPTION:
  Describes an action you perform, visible to everyone in the room.
  Your name is automatically prepended. The : prefix is shorthand for
  emote: ":waves at the crowd." works exactly like "emote waves at
  the crowd."

  emote (and :) is the only action command. There are no separate
  single-word commands like nod, smile, or wave; type out the action
  you want instead.

EXAMPLE:
  emote waves at the crowd.
  :waves at the crowd.

  Output to others: Thurtea waves at the crowd.

SEE ALSO: say, tell, whisper, ooc, pemote
